@startuml
title E Visa Processing and Follow-up System State Diagram

[*] --> CreateAccount

state CreateAccount
CreateAccount : entry / User creates account
CreateAccount : exit / Account created successfully

state Login
Login : entry / Registered user logs in
Login : do / Enter login credentials
Login : exit / Valid username and password

state ApplyVisa
ApplyVisa : entry / User applies for visa after logging in
ApplyVisa : do / Make payment and submit application
ApplyVisa : exit / Application accepted

state ViewStatus
ViewStatus : entry / User views status after applying for visa
ViewStatus : do / Check application status
ViewStatus : exit / Status viewed successfully

state CancelApplication
CancelApplication : entry / User cancels application after logging in
CancelApplication : do / Cancel application
CancelApplication : exit / Application cancelled successfully

state ModifyDetails
ModifyDetails : entry / User modifies details after logging in
ModifyDetails : do / Update user details
ModifyDetails : exit / Details modified successfully

state ViewDetails
ViewDetails : entry / User views details after logging in
ViewDetails : do / Retrieve user details
ViewDetails : exit / Details viewed successfully

state CheckStatus
CheckStatus : entry / User checks status after viewing it
CheckStatus : do / Check application status again
CheckStatus : exit / Status checked successfully

state GiveFeedback
GiveFeedback : entry / User gives feedback after checking status
GiveFeedback : do / Provide feedback on application process
GiveFeedback : exit / Feedback given successfully

state Logout
Logout : entry / User logs out after modifying details, viewing details, giving feedback, or completing status update
Logout : exit / Logged out successfully

CreateAccount --> Login
Login --> ApplyVisa
ApplyVisa --> ViewStatus
ViewStatus --> CheckStatus
CheckStatus --> GiveFeedback
GiveFeedback --> Logout
ApplyVisa --> CancelApplication
Login --> ModifyDetails
ModifyDetails --> Logout
Login --> ViewDetails
ViewDetails --> Logout
Logout --> [*]  // added final transition

@enduml
